 {
  "id": "h02_church",
  "title": "The Church is not walls",
  "source": "Second Homily on Eutropius, 6 (NPNF 1/9)",
  "text": "When I say the Church, I mean not only a place, but also a plan of life. I mean not the walls of the Church, but the laws of the Church. When you take refuge in a Church, do not seek shelter merely in the place, but in the spirit of the place. For the Church is not wall and roof, but faith and life.",
